# Planned months are run OUTPUT, not source — same rule the email chain's
# results/ has always followed. What survives a run is the record on the
# platform plane (platform/data/records/calendar-run/), which carries counts
# and a pointer to wherever the month was written.
runs/*
!runs/.gitkeep
# EXCEPT a month's plan and review (EP-2 (month in the repo), the email lead "save
# the month in the repo", 2026-09-29): the mini reads them after a pull.
!runs/*/
runs/*/*
!runs/*/slots.json
!runs/*/run.json
!runs/*/review.json

# Rebuilt from slots.json + review.json on every load of the board.
**/board.html
**/copy.log

machine/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
